#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_3
msgid ""
"Our Bali Scenic Explorer Bus Tour takes you on an unforgettable journey "
"through the beating heart of this magical island. Leave the bustle behind as "
"you traverse winding roads through the iconic Tegalalang Rice Terraces, "
"sacred jungle sanctuaries, and traditional villages where centuries-old "
"craftsmanship thrives.\n"
"Accompanied by a knowledgeable local guide, you’ll uncover the deep "
"spiritual traditions, colorful daily offerings, and fascinating folklore "
"that define Balinese life."
msgstr ""

#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_4
msgid ""
"Our Rome Historic Discovery Bus Tour invites you to navigate the legendary "
"Seven Hills and uncover the majestic story of the Eternal City. Marvel at "
"the sheer scale of the Colosseum, glide past the ancient ruins of the Roman "
"Forum, and gaze upon the magnificent dome of St. Peter’s Basilica as your "
"panoramic coach winds through historic avenues.\n"
"Guided by an expert storyteller, you’ll journey through eras of gladiators "
"and emperors, Renaissance masters like Michelangelo, and the cinematic "
"romance of La Dolce Vita."
msgstr ""

#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_1
msgid ""
"Our Sydney Coastal &amp; Harbour Bus Tour offers the perfect introduction to "
"this sun-soaked paradise. Trace the picturesque shoreline from the historic "
"cobblestone alleys of The Rocks, past the soaring sails of the Sydney Opera "
"House, and over the majestic Sydney Harbour Bridge to breathtaking cliffside "
"lookouts."
msgstr ""

