#~ msgid ""
#~ "Welcome to <strong>Antwerp</strong>, Belgium’s bold, bustling port city "
#~ "where <strong>diamonds, design, and centuries of history</strong> sparkle "
#~ "side by side. As the country’s fashion capital and one of Europe’s most "
#~ "important trading hubs, Antwerp is a city that has always done things its "
#~ "own way — with flair, creativity, and confidence."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "欢迎来到<strong>安特卫普</strong>——比利时这座大胆而繁华的港口城市。在这"
#~ "里，<strong>钻石、设计与百年历史</strong>交相辉映。作为比利时的时尚之都和"
#~ "欧洲最重要的贸易中心之一，安特卫普始终以其独特的方式——充满格调、创意与自信"
#~ "——展现着自己的魅力。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Welcome to <strong>Brussels</strong>, the capital not only of Belgium, "
#~ "but of Europe itself. A city where history, politics, art, and chocolate "
#~ "all collide in a vibrant, multicultural atmosphere. With its iconic "
#~ "landmarks, whimsical architecture, grand squares, and quirky corners, "
#~ "Brussels is full of surprises — and there’s no better way to experience "
#~ "it all than from the comfort of a guided bus tour."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "欢迎来到<strong>布鲁塞尔</strong>——它不仅是比利时的首都，更是欧洲的心脏。"
#~ "在这座充满活力的多元文化之城，历史、政治、艺术与巧克力激情碰撞。从标志性的"
#~ "地标、梦幻般的建筑，到宏伟的广场和奇特的街角，布鲁塞尔处处充满惊喜——而体验"
#~ "这一切的最佳方式，莫过于乘坐我们舒适的观光巴士。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Whether you're a history lover, an art enthusiast, a curious traveler, or "
#~ "just here for the vibes, <strong>Antwerp will impress you — and our bus "
#~ "tour makes sure you experience it all, effortlessly.</strong>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "无论您是历史爱好者、艺术迷、好奇的旅人，还是只想感受此地氛围，<strong>安特"
#~ "卫普都将给您留下深刻印象——而我们的观光巴士将确保您轻松体验其全部魅力。</"
#~ "strong>"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Whether you're enchanted by history, drawn to culture, or just here to "
#~ "soak in the vibe (and maybe a local beer), this tour is the ideal way to "
#~ "get oriented and inspired. <strong>Ghent is a city of stories — and we "
#~ "can’t wait to tell you some.</strong>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "无论您是为历史着迷，被文化吸引，还是只想沉浸在此地氛围中（或许再来一杯本地"
